  "question": {
    "text": "Two sides of a parallelogram are along the lines, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If its diagonals intersect at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then one of its vertex is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0126_da643440f69f.png\" style=\"width: 330px; height: 168px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8741;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>Slope</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Slope</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;slope of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
